315.go)"] [758 1 "// exactArgs is _PyArg_CheckPositional with min = max: \"NAME expected N arguments, got M\" (CPython's words for"] [759 1 "// a function of positional-only parameters)."] [764 1 "// argCount is _PyArg_CheckPositional: CPython's \"expected N argument(s), got M\", \"at least\", \"at most\"."] [779 1 "// parseKwOnly binds npos positional-only parameters and the keyword-only ones (names): CPython's"] [780 1 "// _PyArg_UnpackKeywords for a signature \"(a, b, /, *, k1, k2)\". The keyword-only ones absent are nil."] [806 1 "// writableExporter is writableBuffer's last case: an exporter of writable memory of another file (queue 204: mmap's"] [807 1 "// WritableBytes), else getargs' TypeError."] [814 2 "// a C type's buffer (queue 473: PyObject_GetBuffer(PyBUF_WRITABLE) of a C exporter, its memory in place while it lives)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[18 30] [26 24] [29 44] [51 30] [61 22] [69 24] [89 23] [126 12] [126 21] [128 13] [128 20] [142 12] [142 21] [144 13] [144 20] [175 6] [175 18] [197 6] [197 20] [218 26] [218 50] [243 12] [243 27] [339 25] [345 35] [347 49] [375 14] [375 27] [376 14] [376 23] [382 7] [382 19] [390 6] [390 17] [393 13] [393 26] [395 13] [395 22] [420 12] [420 27] [508 20] [553 62] [556 71] [567 36] [570 46] [643 32] [658 33] [661 43] [674 37] [677 47] [695 35] [698 47] [707 37] [809 75] [810 32] [815 46]]} (go/file "builtins_binascii.go" :imports [

